{title: Come on everybody let us praise God}

{comment: Chorus}
Come on everybody let us praise God
Come on everybody let us praise God
This might be the last that we might sing and be together
Come on everybody let us praise God

{comment: Bridge}
We’ve come here to give You the praise
We’ve come here to give You the praise
We’ve come so that your name might be lifted up
We’ve come here to give You the praise
